	• Next ₹15,000 (up to ₹30,000) \(\rightarrow \) 5%
	• Residual amount above ₹30,000 \(\rightarrow \) 10%

🛠️ Algorithm & Logic

1. Read name, basic pay, custom structural allowance, overtime hours, and special incentive tokens.
